# Mobile Touch Input

## Assignment constraints (not yet designed)

- Left region: floating virtual stick (appears at touch point, drag steers)
- Right region: tap to jump, release early = shorter hop
- Camera-relative movement with acceleration and deceleration
- Both thumbs must work simultaneously
- Coyote time and jump buffer — named, tunable values (numbers TBD)
- Input System package preferred (already in project)
- Final validation on device, not keyboard

## When design is established

Document input flow, screen regions, and tuned values in the relevant folder `AGENTS.md`. Do not assume controller APIs or class structure until then.
